  "details": "In Desktop mode, untested in VR.\n\nAs shown in the pictures, the cursor is visibly on the tabs but cannot click on them.\n\nUnlike the Quick Menu, the tab interaction areas do not grow with their tabs when they are Hovered or Active. As a result, when the cursor is near their bottom edge:\n\n- Hovered tabs stop appearing hovered.\n\n- Tooltips do not appear.\n\n- Tabs cannot be clicked on and cannot trigger their double-click actions.\n\nThey are also slightly shorter than the Inactive tabs, so Inactive tabs cannot be clicked right near their bottom edge.\n\nImages left-to-right:\n\n- Active tab where it cannot be double-clicked.\n\n- Inactive tab where the cursor cannot click it.\n\n- Inactive tab where the cursor causes it to become Hovered.",
